{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08520","headline":"送赵判官赴黔府中丞叔幕 · 李白","name":"送赵判官赴黔府中丞叔幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"廓落青云心，交结黄金尽。\n富贵翻相忘，令人忽自哂。\n蹭蹬鬓毛斑，盛时难再还。\n巨源咄石生，何事马蹄间。\n绿萝长不厌，却欲还东山。\n君爲鲁曾子，拜揖高堂里。\n叔继赵平原，偏承明主恩。\n风霜推独坐，旌节镇雄藩。\n虎士秉金钺，蛾眉开玉樽。\n才高幕下去，义重林中言。\n水宿五溪月，霜啼三峡猨。\n东风春草绿，江上候归轩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}